  "description": "Additions to front roof volume and internal alterations. Erection of roof extension with rear dormer and installation of 3nos side rooflights.  ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.\r\rReason: This is required by Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).",
    "The development to which this permission relates shall be carried out in accordance with the materials specified on the approved plans and on the submitted application form unless otherwise agreed in writing by the local planning authority.\r\rReason: To ensure a satisfactory appearance on completion of the development, in accordance with Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CS8 and DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012.",
    "The works shall be carried out and maintained in accordance with the deposited Fire Safety Strategy compliant with Policy D12(A).\r\rReason: In the interests of fire safety and to ensure the safety of all building users in accordance with Policy D12 (Fire Safety) of the London Plan 2021.",
    "No development shall take place until a construction phasing/management plan/schedule has been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The construction plan shall detail the phasing/schedule of construction works to ensure that the works to each property are undertaken simultaneously and substantially completed (walls and roof constructed, fenestration in place, internally habitable) within 3 months of eachother. The development shall then be undertaken in compliance with the approved details. \r\rReason: To ensure that the works to each property are undertaken simultaneously and completed and that their amenities are preserved in accordance with Policy DM10 (Design Requirements for New Developments including House Extensions) of the LDF Core Strategy Adopted April 2012."
  ],
